      "role": "user",
      "content": "omg help i just splashed some of that heavy duty drain cleaner in my eye while cleaning the sink its stinging so bad like crazy i feel like something is stuck in there. should i rub it out to get the stuff out or i got some organic chamomile eye drops in the cabinet can i just use those to soothe it??",
