      "content": "wait 30 mins?? i dont have time for that im supposed to be at work in 10 mins. and the chamomile drops feel like they'd be way faster to just calm the sting down. are you sure the chamomile won't help neutralize the burn faster? it's pretty natural so it shouldn't hurt anything right?",
